Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:02.95,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:07.49,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san went out when I took\Nmy eyes off of him for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:10.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, and I had something important to say today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.37,Default,San,0,0,0,,I heard about your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:17.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:20.25,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please! No one was bothered by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.30,Default,San,0,0,0,,Neither Nagisa, me, nor Akio-san was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But society is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:30.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,As proof, I lost a position due to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:34.23,Default,San,0,0,0,,But there's more than one path to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:39.90,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's ready to take any path with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:42.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. She did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.82,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please have faith in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:51.91,Default,San,0,0,0,,Let's have some tea, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:53.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:57.54,Default,San,0,0,0,,Also, if you don't mind, would you try the latest bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:00:59.59,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll bring some out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.38,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, my beloved daughter's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:06.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:08.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Were you out playing baseball again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.72,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:11.39,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Speaking of, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:14.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I called in and said I had something to say, so I'd be stopping by!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:18.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You're just here to buy bread, so don't make it so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:20.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm not here to buy bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:24.90,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Just so you know, you're not getting any discount even if you are my daughter's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:26.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll charge you double instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.57,0:01:29.03,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But Sanae's bread is a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.03,0:01:30.82,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You can buy those at the listed price.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom's standing behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:36.83,Default,San,0,0,0,,So my... my bread is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:40.38,Default,San,0,0,0,,...meant to be bought at the listed price?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:40.38,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:42.71,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What's the problem with selling it at the listed price?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:47.51,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I love them-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.26,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:49.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I have something important to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:50.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.85,0:01:55.64,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, something to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. A serious talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right. In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.61,0:02:05.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's time we settle this seriously.
