Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:39.83,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Graduation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.58,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I haven't been this excited in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why does it turn out this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:51.22,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm called the baker Cy Young around the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:54.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Try to hit my 170 kph fastball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:58.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You do know I have a bad shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:02.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It was you who ended a game sometime ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna ask for a home run out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:06.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hit something that looks like it'll be a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:12.11,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We'll say you win if it's not a grounder or a pop-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:14.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you really fine with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:17.74,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah. If you win, I'll listen to what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:18.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:23.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Promise to accept whatever I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:29.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoy-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:35.76,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:39.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If you win, I'll accept anything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.77,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But if I win, I'm not gonna bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.23,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:44.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:46.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:47.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ready, brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:13.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Come again whenever you want to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:19.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:21.31,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:25.52,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,To miss the chance because of something stupid like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:29.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,You might achieve it if you keep working for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:35.94,Default,San,0,0,0,,How about another try for Nagisa's sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:47.71,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:50.75,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I have a battle that'll determine my life waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:57.51,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This brat doesn't know when to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:58.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:01.97,Default,San,0,0,0,,Good luck to both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:05.77,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Try to hit my forkball that drops a whole meter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:06.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go be a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:18.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:25.99,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Why do we have to battle in this weather?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Weather means nothing in serious matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:32.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,The bath's ready for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:34.42,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's not going to make any difference no matter how many times you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.88,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:37.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.52,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You won't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:56.90,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,That's how big the gap in strength is between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:03.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:06.91,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I think he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:09.29,Default,San,0,0,0,,Knows what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:12.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I feel like he hinted it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:15.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"You're still just a kid."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:19.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"You're a fool to try to protect someone else."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.55,0:07:21.43,Default,San,0,0,0,,You're thinking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:24.55,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san is always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.47,Default,San,0,0,0,,Come, let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.47,0:07:28.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I'm going to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:32.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If there's a gap in strength, then all I have left is passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:34.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll keep practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:35.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.31,Default,San,0,0,0,,That is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:37.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:39.48,Default,San,0,0,0,,I won't stop you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:42.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,Since, after all, it's a very important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:47.49,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll return to where Akio-san is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.49,Default,San,0,0,0,,You should come, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:50.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:55.50,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa. You mustn't get in their way when men battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:07:58.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.51,0:08:04.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:30.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:37.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:41.42,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It sure rains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:43.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Is it one of those rainy autumns?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:50.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This really is the last pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:50.97,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:12.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.20,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's a home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:22.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please give Nagisa to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.85,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,He really is like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:40.90,Default,San,0,0,0,,I knew that since long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.90,0:09:42.19,Default,San,0,0,0,,He's really like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:45.36,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I was frantic to become an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:47.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,And I was still just a kid back then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.82,Default,San,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Lift your head up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:10:01.33,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If Nagisa goes through anything sad, I'm gonna snatch her away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:02.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:03.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:10.47,Default,San,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.47,0:10:13.26,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa is our dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:17.73,Default,San,0,0,0,,And starting today, you are our dream, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:21.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,The happiness between you two is our dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:24.90,Default,San,0,0,0,,So please seize your happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:34.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Winter came.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:42.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This Christmas, I spent alone with Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.31,0:10:56.56,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs30\c&H292B2C&\b1\pos(654,66)}End of Year Notice: Furukawa Bread is closed \Nfrom {\c&H313596&}12/29{\c&H292B2C&} to {\c&H313596&}1/3{\c&H292B2C&}. We are sorry for the\N inconvenience and we hope to see you \Nnext year. Furukawa Bread Owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:10:59.81,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this year to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.48,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,The day I can drink with my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've never had alcohol before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:07.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No. This is my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:13.95,Default,San,0,0,0,,You don't have to force yourself, Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:18.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, I will at least drink one cup for Dad's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:19.12,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:23.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I have never been gladder to have given birth to you than this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:24.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't feel that over something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:31.30,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Yay! Look at her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, are you really all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:45.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're sitting so far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:54.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Now you're closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:56.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're completely drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:58.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:00.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's what everyone says when they're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:03.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:06.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,What a lovey-dovey couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Does this count as lovey-dovey, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:09.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:10.55,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is Mom that interesting to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.72,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,What are you saying all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:17.26,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'd like to know the truth to that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:20.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why are you drinking, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.77,0:12:24.48,Default,San,0,0,0,,Are you interested in me, Tomoya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:26.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Are you, Tomoya-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.48,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,A hell of a battle this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,One of them is your wife, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:32.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Answer me, Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.11,0:12:34.86,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:36.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:37.87,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae has huge boobs, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:42.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun! Why are you panicking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:44.37,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's proof he's interested in Sanae.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:44.83,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm not! I'm not! I'm not! I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:46.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I mean, I do like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:49.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,As a person, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So you do like her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.84,0:12:54.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What the heck did I do to deserve this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:57.09,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Stop playing with him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:13:00.10,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What's so great about being liked by him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:01.97,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm not playing with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:03.35,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:04.52,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:06.56,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae! What are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:06.56,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,Make up your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.81,0:13:11.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,She's sound asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:13.86,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa's very blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:15.32,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.65,0:13:17.61,Default,San,0,0,0,,How about you, Tomoya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:25.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll be happy as long as I can be with her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:36.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When third semester came around, Nagisa became sick again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:40.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe I took you around too much over the break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:45.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No. I'm always like this during this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Will you be able to graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:49.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Apparently that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:54.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I have enough attendance even if I skip the rest of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:55.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:57.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:13:59.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:06.54,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}Sign: Hikarizaka Private High School Graduation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The day of graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.21,0:14:15.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa sat looking out toward the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:19.55,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:20.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is that Mei-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:24.85,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:26.39,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:27.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:28.39,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:31.44,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Are you and Nagisa-san doing well, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:32.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So-so, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:34.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is Sunohara there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:37.82,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan's living at the dorm, so he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:38.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Dorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.41,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,The company dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:43.91,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Would you like his number?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.20,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:49.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Sunohara. It's me, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:51.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:54.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Good, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:58.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This company's pretty unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:14:59.59,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Here, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:01.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll listen to you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:03.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right now, listen to what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:04.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, whenever is best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:13.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll have to make it work with everyone else's schedule, but I'll find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:14.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:19.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm right in the middle of the training period,\Nso I'll get fired if I leave the dorm without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.36,0:15:20.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:21.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're telling me to get fired?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:23.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A day wouldn't kill you, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.95,0:15:25.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't make it sound so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:27.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This company's really inflexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please! Think of it as a favor for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:31.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You mean for Nagisa-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:34.29,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Well, if it's just one day, I think I can make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:35.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:41.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm such a good guy to go through\Nall this for someone else's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's why I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:45.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:48.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You can catch me at this hour, so call again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:50.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:58.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:00.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Glad you came, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:06.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Walking like this reminds me of\Nthe days we walked to school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:07.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Can we enter without permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:16.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I already got permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:18.29,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:24.84,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:26.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:27.93,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:29.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:32.60,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,How can you say that after seeing me for the first time in ages?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:38.98,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Anyone would laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:41.69,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I thought it was someone else at first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:42.65,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:46.91,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Until you two came, we were playing with Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.62,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I was surprised at first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:53.91,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's not him without the blond hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.67,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Then how about we all dye it for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.67,0:16:58.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll get fired from work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:01.63,Default,Rie,0,0,0,,How are you, Furukawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm doing well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:08.34,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,It's really great that we were all able to gather like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:14.23,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Yeah. It was a shame you couldn't come to graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:18.52,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Both Rie-chan and I managed to work out our schedules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:23.11,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's a small miracle we were all able to get together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:26.24,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,If I were to add a word, it's a miracle of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:28.11,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,That's exactly right, Yoshino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:30.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, I'm still having trouble\Nunderstanding what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.46,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:41.71,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Your graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:54.97,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Koumura-sensei asked the school for permission to use the campus for today's event.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:59.73,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I can't deny a favor asked by my last students.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:02.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:08.91,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,We will now start the graduation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:18.08,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Furukawa Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:19.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:30.13,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Certificate of graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:35.81,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,We certify that you have met all criteria set forth by this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:45.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.42,0:19:06.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I experienced lots of hardship at this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:12.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm shy, withdrawn, and bad at making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:17.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,After becoming a senior, I couldn't attend enough classes and had to repeat the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:25.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The spring of my second senior year, I was alone in my new class.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:33.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,When I learned that there's nothing that doesn't change with the flow of time, I couldn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:38.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So I stood helplessly at the bottom of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:44.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,And, it was Tomoya-kun who gave me a push to my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:49.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Since then, I've met many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:54.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,With the support of everyone here, I formed the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:58.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,At the School Festival, I was even able to stand on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:06.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But soon after that, I became ill again\Nand had to repeat my senior year again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.57,0:20:10.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even so, I thought I'd give it my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:14.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I wanted to be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:19.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I have a weak body, but I wanted to live strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:24.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The ones who gave me the strength to do that are all of you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:37.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,{\fs72.9}I was in a different class from Tomoyo-san, Miyazawa-san, and Nishina-san, so I spent most of this year by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:42.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even... Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:47.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think of the school days here as very valuable ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:54.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It took me five years to graduate, but I love this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:58.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's because this is the place I worked so hard at.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.58,0:21:02.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.67,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Congratulations for graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.09,0:21:10.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa's long...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...long school days...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:15.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:16.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:24.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm going to be married to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:26.02,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:27.60,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:33.82,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Ah... Nagisa-san, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:38.70,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Please take care of Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:40.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll be in your care, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:42.29,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I wish you a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:55.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We dropped off our marriage registration.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:01.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okazaki Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:05.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's Nagisa's name starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:41.35,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:48.44,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:55.74,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.57,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:43.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.17,0:24:00.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Calm down. I've heard the sound of Nagisa showering in that house many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.55,0:24:02.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:05.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Cold water came out...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 14
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs85.000002\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,765)\3c&H000008&\blur0.5\bord0.75}A New Family
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:09.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is how Nagisa and my new life started.
